    <entry>
      <title>安全研究资料清单（入门向）</title>
      <link href="/post/security-checklist/"/>
      <url>/post/security-checklist/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="练习靶场"><a href="#练习靶场" class="headerlink" title="练习靶场"></a>练习靶场</h2><table><thead><tr><th>靶场</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>DVWA</td><td>经典的 Web 漏洞靶场，适合入门</td></tr><tr><td>Vulhub</td><td>基于 Docker 的漏洞复现环境</td></tr><tr><td>HackTheBox</td><td>在线渗透挑战平台</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="常用工具"><a href="#常用工具" class="headerlink" title="常用工具"></a>常用工具</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 信息收集</span></span><br><span class="line">nmap -sV -sC &lt;target&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 目录扫描</span></span><br><span class="line">gobuster <span class="built_in">dir</span> -u http://target.com -w wordlist.txt</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 爆破</span></span><br><span class="line">hydra -l admin -P pass.txt &lt;target&gt; http-post-form</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>注意：所有练习请在法律允许的范围内，对授权目标进行。</p></blockquote><h2 id="学习路线建议"><a href="#学习路线建议" class="headerlink" title="学习路线建议"></a>学习路线建议</h2><ol><li>计算机网络与 HTTP 协议基础</li><li>常见 Web 漏洞原理（SQLi、XSS、SSRF、RCE 等）</li><li>漏洞靶场实操（DVWA → Vulhub）</li><li>工具链熟练（Burp Suite、nmap、sqlmap）</li><li>实战：CTF 比赛 &#x2F; 众测平台</li></ol><p>持续更新中……</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
        <tags>
            
